/-!
# The chunks of segment 4, joined

The shard theorems of segment `4` joined into one statement over all its chunks (`Assemble.forall_lt_succ_of`).
-/

public section

namespace SandierSerfaty.CertData

open SandierSerfaty.Certificate.Arith SandierSerfaty.Certificate.Basis SandierSerfaty.Certificate.Table
